// What scripts/check-ts-prune.cjs asks about: the app, without its tests.
//
// Over tsconfig.json an export only a test imports counts as used, so code the
// app had stopped calling stayed in it for as long as its tests did —
// `parsePoints` and `pointsToText` were two re-exports of the kit's lexer kept
// alive by nine tests of that lexer. The harness in src/test goes too: every
// export there is for a test, which is what it is for. Nothing builds or
// type-checks against this file; `tsc -b`, eslint and the editor read
// tsconfig.json.
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "exclude": ["src/**/*.test.ts", "src/**/*.test.tsx", "src/test"]
}
